# __PROJECT_NAME__

Offline Godot starter generated by GameAgent.

## Run

Open `project.godot` with Godot 4.7 .NET, or run the project headlessly. The
sample uses a deterministic provider and requires no API key. A successful run
prints `GODOT_SAMPLE_PASS`.

## Replace the sample

Start in `samples/basic/SampleRuntimeFactory.cs`:

1. Replace the structured observation with game-owned context.
2. Replace `gather_food` with one authoritative game action.
3. Keep the deterministic provider until the engine action path passes.
4. Configure a real provider through an `IProviderCredentialSource`.
5. Replace the temporary journal with a path under `user://`.

The Agent Runtime does not own game rules or state. The registered handler is
the authority for every mutation and must return the real `ActionReceipt`.
